\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces  Median (solid) and fifth-percentile (hatched) coefficient of determination $R^2$ for the four architectures on the in-distribution ($|\bm  {c}| \leq 0.5$, left) and out-of-distribution ($|\bm  {c}| \in [0.5, 1.0]$, right) held-out scenarios. The Intention head with learned basis ($\bm  {\psi }_\theta $) reaches the highest fifth-percentile $R^2$ in both regions and beats the cheat regressor that violates the architectural constraint.}}{7}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:inside-outside}{{1}{7}{Median (solid) and fifth-percentile (hatched) coefficient of determination $R^2$ for the four architectures on the in-distribution ($|\bm {c}| \leq 0.5$, left) and out-of-distribution ($|\bm {c}| \in [0.5, 1.0]$, right) held-out scenarios. The Intention head with learned basis ($\psib _\theta $) reaches the highest fifth-percentile $R^2$ in both regions and beats the cheat regressor that violates the architectural constraint}{figure.caption.2}{}}
